{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Still Vienna! My effects have already been handed over to the shipping agent, — some additions, — the subtractions belong to the travel expenses; — these, however, are no heathen money, but everything was spent on Christians and used for me — also a good Christian. Now, after the completion of such business, to — where? To the Italian Theatre! To — first, the popular song — as today on St. Francis’s Day. — The rainy weather, however, did not allow illuminations to appear, which otherwise would have been perhaps the only celebration of this day; I could learn nothing of any further fuss. I also celebrated this day by listening to the aforementioned song, performed on one side by Mrs. Fodor à la tête, then Dardanelli and so on, 13 in number, and on the other side by Signor David à la tête, Donzelli, also Rubini, Lablache, Ambrogi, Bassi, da Franco etc., 16 men high — although unison, but without solos, variations. So for such means not enough action, — the men in black, the ladies in white satin! The house was this time packed full, probably for Francis’s Day, also for the sake of the German Opera, which was given for the first time today, — French music performed by Germans and German women. On the one hand, because of the packed full house, I had for the first time the opportunity to see very many, i.e., several pretty ladies, and on the other hand I could notice more of the Viennese ladies on my part, because I did not have to see and hear Italians and Italian women on the stage. I also pass from that to the German Opera, i.e., the French charming music by Auber, performed by German throats! In the last act, passion comes into the voices through a French coup, and here they let themselves go, but earlier the soul of the song only comes to peeping and longing and being small-voiced. — But with the Italians there is immediately longing-free sound, and the metal of the nature from the first moment on, ignited and in motion; the first sound is freedom and passion, — the first tone immediately goes with free breast and soul blessed into the fray! — the divine Furore is from the start melodic"}}],"created":1795080314,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":487,"prompt_tokens":594,"total_tokens":1081,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-DdL3BiuOKGqG919fD2DOLTvRTqPSdhhV","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":594,"prompt_ms":755.105,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.2712205387205389,"prompt_per_second":786.6455658484582,"predicted_n":487,"predicted_ms":11616.258,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.901765432098767,"predicted_per_second":41.83791372402369}}